WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 14=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.060
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:52.980 --> 01:55.700
(Lin Residence, Pengjian Study)

01:57.760 --> 01:58.880
Mother.

02:04.070 --> 02:06.509
Isn't the Xie family coming today?

02:06.510 --> 02:08.239
Why are you dressed so casually?

02:08.240 --> 02:10.350
You're not even
wearing any proper jewelry.

02:10.750 --> 02:11.149
Come.

02:11.150 --> 02:12.350
Xiuwan.

02:13.030 --> 02:14.470
Let me help you choose something.

02:15.150 --> 02:16.280
Xiuwan.

02:27.960 --> 02:29.350
This one looks nice.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.070
Here.

02:33.870 --> 02:35.000
Xiuwan.

02:35.910 --> 02:39.190
The Xie family isn't coming.

02:41.080 --> 02:42.600
They're not coming today?

02:43.560 --> 02:45.029
What day has it been changed to?

02:45.030 --> 02:46.350
Why was it changed?

02:49.740 --> 02:53.460
(Nanxing, Madam Wang's
First-Class Maid)

03:06.960 --> 03:07.959
I don't believe it!

03:07.960 --> 03:08.728
I don't believe it!

03:08.730 --> 03:09.880
I don't believe it!

03:11.030 --> 03:12.280
I don't believe it!

03:12.430 --> 03:13.750
I don't believe it!

03:14.150 --> 03:15.440
I don't believe it!

03:15.750 --> 03:18.149
Xie Zhao and my brother
get along so well.

03:18.150 --> 03:19.469
He would never go back

03:19.470 --> 03:20.559
on his word over some

03:20.560 --> 03:22.280
baseless rumors.

03:23.360 --> 03:24.600
I don't believe it!

03:24.840 --> 03:26.880
Xie Zhao isn't that kind of person!

03:27.240 --> 03:28.790
I don't believe it.

03:34.520 --> 03:35.680
Xiuwan.

03:37.750 --> 03:39.440
Listen to me.

03:40.960 --> 03:42.750
I know you're upset.

03:44.240 --> 03:45.559
I'll find you

03:45.560 --> 03:47.070
an even better match.

03:48.520 --> 03:50.320
Better than the Xie family.

03:50.856 --> 03:52.420
No matter how good anyone else is,

03:52.430 --> 03:53.559
I don't want them.

03:53.560 --> 03:55.309
I only want Xie Zhao!

03:55.310 --> 03:56.629
Only Xie Zhao!

03:56.630 --> 03:57.950
All right.

04:03.080 --> 04:04.840
If I'd known this would happen,

04:07.360 --> 04:10.400
I never would've invited
the Xie family to the Festival of Man.

04:10.590 --> 04:12.190
Look what it's done to you...

04:15.520 --> 04:17.630
What a cruel twist of fate.

04:18.120 --> 04:19.880
What a cruel twist of fate.

04:22.430 --> 04:23.559
Xiuwan.

04:23.560 --> 04:24.950
It's all right.

04:25.480 --> 04:26.560
It's all right.

04:27.870 --> 04:29.000
Xiuwan.

04:30.430 --> 04:32.039
Don't frighten me.

04:32.040 --> 04:33.150
Say something.

04:35.560 --> 04:37.070
I'll go find Jinqi.

04:37.510 --> 04:39.680
I'll ask him to speak to Xie Zhao.

04:40.240 --> 04:42.070
If this is only
the Xie family's decision,

04:42.480 --> 04:44.190
then we can wait a little longer.

04:44.360 --> 04:46.700
Once Jinqi clears up the matter,

04:46.710 --> 04:48.990
the Xie family will naturally
discuss the marriage again.

04:49.016 --> 04:49.740
Xiuwan.

04:49.750 --> 04:50.749
Listen to me.

04:50.750 --> 04:51.949
Xiuwan.

04:51.950 --> 04:53.150
Xiuwan!

05:03.310 --> 05:04.360
Young Lady.

05:05.190 --> 05:06.119
Young Lady.

05:06.120 --> 05:07.070
Young Lady.

05:12.070 --> 05:13.190
Jinqi.

05:16.750 --> 05:17.429
My brother

05:17.430 --> 05:19.749
is an Assistant Commander
of the Shence Garrison.

05:19.750 --> 05:21.880
What right do you have to arrest him?

05:23.016 --> 05:25.060
If you can't give me
a proper explanation today,

05:25.070 --> 05:26.950
you won't be taking my brother anywhere.

05:27.220 --> 05:29.309
(Yang Chong, Fifth-Rank)
Assistant Commander?

05:29.310 --> 05:31.309
(Judicial Officer of the Central Military Command)
That's all in the past.

05:31.310 --> 05:33.479
Lin Jinqi colluded
with corrupt merchants,

05:33.480 --> 05:34.829
harmed the soldiers,

05:34.830 --> 05:37.559
and forced Lu Dalang
to take his own life.

05:37.560 --> 05:40.390
The Five Military Commissions
have ordered his immediate dismissal

05:40.472 --> 05:42.040
and detention pending investigation.

05:42.360 --> 05:43.949
Anyone who obstructs official business

05:43.950 --> 05:45.440
will be executed on the spot.

05:51.120 --> 05:53.069
My brother would never do such things.

05:53.070 --> 05:54.560
You're falsely accusing him.

05:55.310 --> 05:56.750
This is my second younger sister.

05:57.120 --> 05:59.680
Please show
the Lin family some consideration

06:00.040 --> 06:01.800
and allow me a few words with her.

06:22.310 --> 06:24.480
I was only assisting
with the investigation before.

06:24.750 --> 06:25.949
Trust me.

06:25.950 --> 06:27.360
I didn't embezzle anything.

06:28.750 --> 06:30.239
The sooner the truth is uncovered,

06:30.240 --> 06:32.070
the sooner my name will be cleared.

06:34.510 --> 06:35.630
Really?

06:36.310 --> 06:37.480
Really.

06:42.560 --> 06:43.680
Jinqi,

06:43.830 --> 06:45.800
you have to keep your word.

06:45.950 --> 06:47.800
You must come back safely.

06:50.430 --> 06:51.750
All these years,

06:52.040 --> 06:53.590
when have I ever

06:53.630 --> 06:55.070
broken a promise to you?

06:55.870 --> 06:57.000
All right.

07:02.950 --> 07:04.070
Take him away.

07:39.950 --> 07:41.150
So many people.

07:41.270 --> 07:42.390
Xiuwan.

07:43.630 --> 07:44.949
Don't cry.

07:44.950 --> 07:46.070
It's all right.

07:46.270 --> 07:47.560
Where's Jinqi?

07:48.560 --> 07:51.040
Jinqi was arrested.

07:53.160 --> 07:54.830
Jinqi was arrested?

07:55.040 --> 07:55.869
This...

07:55.870 --> 07:57.070
That wretched boy.

07:57.360 --> 07:58.920
That wretched boy!

07:59.160 --> 08:00.376
I told you long ago,

08:00.408 --> 08:03.150
if he offended the Zhao family
and still wanted to remain an official,

08:03.160 --> 08:04.910
he'd be dismissed
and investigated anyway,

08:04.920 --> 08:06.030
and then thrown into prison.

08:06.040 --> 08:07.176
Now look what's happened.

08:07.750 --> 08:08.919
We don't even know

08:08.920 --> 08:10.040
if he'll make it out alive.

08:12.560 --> 08:14.749
A tall tree catches the wind,

08:14.750 --> 08:18.360
and great fame can bring a man to ruin.

08:20.680 --> 08:22.680
Stop making things worse.

08:23.240 --> 08:24.360
This...

08:25.624 --> 08:27.920
- First Madam!
- First Madam!

08:28.120 --> 08:28.629
Shunhua!

08:28.630 --> 08:29.239
Shunhua.

08:29.240 --> 08:29.919
Check on her.

08:29.920 --> 08:30.919
Is she all right?

08:30.920 --> 08:32.000
Help us.

08:33.440 --> 08:34.459
Young Lady.

08:34.460 --> 08:36.259
- Is the Lin family finished?
- Look at you, you fool.

08:36.260 --> 08:37.100
Look what you've done.

08:37.110 --> 08:38.099
What are we going to do?

08:38.100 --> 08:39.650
What does this have to do with me?

08:39.670 --> 08:42.056
- Go help them. Hurry.
- How is this none of your business?

08:43.610 --> 08:45.600
I don't even want to speak to you.

09:21.880 --> 09:23.430
These are clothes and other necessities

09:23.448 --> 09:24.870
your family asked me to bring you.

09:25.600 --> 09:26.230
Here.

09:29.360 --> 09:30.470
Give them to me.

09:31.736 --> 09:33.272
Your family wanted to visit you,

09:33.288 --> 09:34.488
but Commander Xu gave orders

09:34.490 --> 09:36.280
that no family members
are allowed to visit.

09:36.320 --> 09:38.719
Even I had to use
the investigation as an excuse

09:38.720 --> 09:39.870
to get in.

09:40.480 --> 09:41.830
What's happening outside?

09:42.320 --> 09:45.749
They're saying you colluded
with corrupt merchants and took bribes,

09:45.750 --> 09:48.760
passed off inferior goods as quality
ones, and recklessly endangered lives.

09:49.464 --> 09:50.740
Afraid the truth would come out,

09:50.750 --> 09:53.029
you even led armed men
into a private residence

09:53.030 --> 09:55.239
to kill witnesses and destroy evidence,

09:55.240 --> 09:57.560
driving Lu Dalang to his death.

09:57.960 --> 09:59.749
I was trying to bring Lu Dalang back

09:59.750 --> 10:00.959
and uncover the truth.

10:00.960 --> 10:03.440
But now he's dead, so there's
no one to corroborate your story.

10:03.720 --> 10:04.749
Even if I believe you,

10:04.750 --> 10:06.760
the Central Military Command doesn't.

10:12.750 --> 10:14.040
There's something else.

10:14.510 --> 10:16.440
I'm not sure if I should tell you.

10:17.840 --> 10:20.070
Can it be any worse than this?

10:22.550 --> 10:24.470
You shouldn't have asked.

10:24.670 --> 10:26.800
That Young Lady Zhao

10:26.870 --> 10:28.470
is engaged again.

10:29.960 --> 10:32.800
To the Deputy Chief Censor
of the Censorate.

10:33.510 --> 10:34.830
Dai Rong's father?

10:36.030 --> 10:38.470
Have you been cursed
with bad luck or something?

10:38.616 --> 10:40.792
The Censorate serves
as the Emperor's eyes and ears,

10:40.808 --> 10:42.740
keeping watch over
officials and impeaching them.

10:42.750 --> 10:44.959
It was bad enough
that you offended Dai Rong.

10:44.960 --> 10:47.280
Now he has someone
whispering in his ear.

10:47.320 --> 10:50.264
The Central Military Command has
no choice but to deal with you severely.

10:55.960 --> 10:58.239
I'm worried there'll be
more memorials impeaching you.

10:58.240 --> 11:00.079
His Majesty may issue
an edict to punish you.

11:00.080 --> 11:01.119
If that happens,

11:01.120 --> 11:03.440
there'll truly
be no room to turn things around.

11:03.960 --> 11:05.350
You've always been quick-witted.

11:05.360 --> 11:06.870
Think of something.

11:06.960 --> 11:07.830
I'm off.

11:07.910 --> 11:08.870
Take care.

11:38.550 --> 11:39.760
Xiuwan.

11:39.960 --> 11:42.319
The Xie family has already arranged
a marriage for Xie Zhao.

11:42.320 --> 11:44.890
It's with the sixth young lady
of the Zhao family's third branch.

11:45.270 --> 11:47.470
You have to give up on him.

11:49.080 --> 11:50.149
Xiuru,

11:50.150 --> 11:51.590
what should we do?

12:05.150 --> 12:06.319
Xiuwan,

12:06.320 --> 12:07.629
don't be upset.

12:07.630 --> 12:09.272
Didn't Old Master say

12:09.352 --> 12:11.352
that as long as Jinqi
conducts himself honorably,

12:11.360 --> 12:13.448
he has nothing to fear
from those who wish him ill?

12:13.480 --> 12:14.950
Once the case is cleared up,

12:14.960 --> 12:16.950
Jinqi's name will be cleared, too.

12:17.720 --> 12:18.869
That's right.

12:18.870 --> 12:20.280
She's right.

12:20.550 --> 12:21.549
Xiuwan,

12:21.550 --> 12:23.040
don't cry.

12:25.080 --> 12:26.520
What do you know?

12:27.160 --> 12:28.888
I can't be
bothered explaining it to you.

13:16.080 --> 13:18.870
(Is that Xie Zhao?)

13:20.480 --> 13:22.520
(Why is he here?)

13:48.910 --> 13:51.040
Xiuwan seems to have stopped crying.

13:53.960 --> 13:55.440
She has.

13:57.720 --> 13:59.959
I never knew Xiuwan and Jinqi

13:59.960 --> 14:01.760
were so close.

14:02.120 --> 14:03.760
I can't even bring myself to cry.

14:04.150 --> 14:05.950
Xiuru, what about you?

14:06.960 --> 14:08.070
I...

14:09.150 --> 14:10.160
I...

14:10.840 --> 14:11.269
I...

14:11.270 --> 14:12.680
I know.

14:16.150 --> 14:18.470
Should we go over?

14:48.750 --> 14:50.029
I found the koi in the pond

14:50.030 --> 14:51.640
and the mandarin ducks so delightful

14:51.960 --> 14:53.640
that I became lost in watching them.

14:53.928 --> 14:56.070
I hope I haven't
disturbed you, Young Lady Lin.

14:58.440 --> 15:00.070
This is my favorite spot, too.

15:00.960 --> 15:03.870
It's a shame I didn't
bring any pastries today.

15:03.960 --> 15:06.509
Otherwise, if you scatter
some crumbs into the pond,

15:06.510 --> 15:08.359
the koi will gather right at your feet.

15:08.360 --> 15:09.680
It's quite a sight.

15:11.030 --> 15:12.520
If I get another chance,

15:12.630 --> 15:15.560
I'll bring something to feed the fish.

15:17.130 --> 15:19.199
♪A faint trace of fragrance♪

15:19.200 --> 15:21.159
♪Softly lingers in the air♪

15:21.160 --> 15:25.089
♪As the years slowly turn another page♪

15:25.090 --> 15:27.679
♪Your shimmering gaze♪

15:27.680 --> 15:31.930
♪Keeps stirring the tides of fate♪

15:32.820 --> 15:34.819
♪The graceful waves♪

15:34.820 --> 15:36.799
♪Sway gently to and fro♪

15:36.800 --> 15:40.770
♪Yet my heart is caught in the flurry♪

15:41.330 --> 15:43.309
♪And you fall into my heart♪

15:43.310 --> 15:48.590
♪There are still many chapters ahead♪

15:49.130 --> 15:51.119
♪I can't forget♪

15:51.120 --> 15:53.149
♪My longing fills my eyes♪

15:53.150 --> 15:56.560
♪I long to be with you forever♪

15:57.040 --> 15:59.309
♪Love lingers all around us♪

15:59.310 --> 16:00.549
Xiuwan is smiling.

16:00.550 --> 16:01.999
Zheng must have brought

16:02.000 --> 16:03.710
good news about Jinqi.

16:06.150 --> 16:07.760
Who did you say that man was?

16:08.750 --> 16:09.749
Zheng.

16:09.750 --> 16:12.440
Cuique's brother from Luxue Lodge.

16:12.670 --> 16:14.040
The one who saved Jinqi's life.

16:17.630 --> 16:18.830
Are you sure?

16:19.320 --> 16:20.119
I'm sure.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.839
When I was in First Madam's room,

16:21.840 --> 16:23.959
Zheng came to pay his respects to her.

16:23.960 --> 16:26.400
First Madam even
had me greet him properly.

16:34.270 --> 16:34.749
Come on.

16:34.750 --> 16:35.629
Let's go listen too

16:35.630 --> 16:37.280
and see what the good news is.

16:37.750 --> 16:38.800
What are you doing?

16:39.030 --> 16:40.000
Shh.

16:40.480 --> 16:41.870
Covering my mouth again?

16:42.360 --> 16:43.680
I won't say anything.

16:54.840 --> 16:56.040
Why are you

16:56.720 --> 16:57.870
suddenly

16:58.320 --> 17:00.040
here in our garden?

17:01.750 --> 17:02.870
Did you come to...

17:06.880 --> 17:08.630
To see someone?

17:12.200 --> 17:14.800
My sister and I
are going to offer incense

17:15.350 --> 17:16.910
and pray for Fengtai's safety.

17:17.000 --> 17:18.260
Before leaving the residence,

17:18.270 --> 17:20.560
we were going to pay
our respects to First Madam together.

17:21.270 --> 17:22.670
On the way there,

17:22.750 --> 17:24.952
my sister suddenly realized
she'd forgotten something

17:25.240 --> 17:26.630
and asked me to wait here.

17:27.960 --> 17:29.630
Pay your respects to First Madam?

17:30.960 --> 17:33.000
Not Second Madam?

17:34.880 --> 17:36.000
Zheng.

17:39.290 --> 17:40.390
Xiuwan.

17:40.510 --> 17:42.070
What are you talking about?

17:42.720 --> 17:44.430
While I was enjoying the scenery,

17:44.920 --> 17:46.520
I happened to run into Young Lady Lin.

17:46.960 --> 17:48.430
We were talking about the view.

17:49.480 --> 17:53.670
You're brother and sister?

17:57.310 --> 17:58.800
You are...

18:00.790 --> 18:02.560
This is my brother, Du Zheng.

18:02.640 --> 18:03.829
Zheng heard

18:03.830 --> 18:06.150
that Jinqi was taken away
by the Central Military Command

18:06.160 --> 18:07.639
and has been very worried about him.

18:07.640 --> 18:10.670
He took leave especially
to accompany me to offer incense.

18:12.200 --> 18:13.520
You are...

18:15.070 --> 18:16.320
Du Zheng?

18:18.000 --> 18:19.320
That's me.

18:22.160 --> 18:23.280
Xiuwan,

18:23.750 --> 18:25.350
let's talk again next time.

18:25.440 --> 18:26.439
Zheng and I

18:26.440 --> 18:27.919
still have to go offer incense

18:27.920 --> 18:29.560
after paying our respects
to First Madam.

18:32.270 --> 18:33.390
Second Young Lady Lin,

18:34.350 --> 18:35.480
I'll take my leave.

18:50.750 --> 18:53.040
He's not Xie Zhao.

18:55.160 --> 18:56.670
He's Du Zheng.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.110
Xiuwan,

19:03.440 --> 19:05.999
what news did Zheng bring about Jinqi?

19:06.000 --> 19:07.069
One moment you're happy,

19:07.070 --> 19:08.390
and the next you're troubled.

19:09.270 --> 19:10.350
It's nothing.

19:12.250 --> 19:13.140
You've

19:13.750 --> 19:15.040
met him before?

19:15.790 --> 19:17.000
Zheng?

19:17.590 --> 19:18.879
First Madam said Zheng

19:18.880 --> 19:21.549
is capable, brave, and kind.

19:21.550 --> 19:23.029
He even saved Jinqi's life.

19:23.030 --> 19:24.549
She told me to respect Zheng

19:24.550 --> 19:26.110
just as I respect Jinqi.

19:27.400 --> 19:30.590
It seems Aunt Shunhua
really likes Zheng.

19:31.832 --> 19:33.740
First Madam
even said she wanted to find

19:33.750 --> 19:35.159
a good match for Zheng.

19:35.160 --> 19:37.439
But she worried
that with such a fine young man,

19:37.440 --> 19:39.784
she didn't know which young lady
would be a worthy match.

19:43.240 --> 19:44.480
I never expected

19:44.750 --> 19:46.000
such a coincidence.

19:47.000 --> 19:48.480
What didn't you expect?

19:48.750 --> 19:49.870
Nothing.

19:51.350 --> 19:52.349
I'm going back.

19:52.350 --> 19:53.720
You two can keep playing.

20:09.830 --> 20:12.040
(Xie Zhao has become Du Zheng.)

20:12.270 --> 20:14.430
(Their family backgrounds
and status are worlds apart.)

20:15.030 --> 20:17.280
(Yet Xiuwan
doesn't seem to care at all.)

20:17.750 --> 20:19.280
(She's simply happy.)

20:22.720 --> 20:23.439
Xiuru.

20:23.440 --> 20:25.239
Let's go see Second Sister-in-Law.

20:25.240 --> 20:27.280
We can listen
to Jinlan tell stories, too.

20:30.750 --> 20:31.630
All right.

20:38.590 --> 20:40.520
Second Young Lady may seem willful,

20:40.550 --> 20:43.870
but I never expected her to be so loyal.

20:45.200 --> 20:47.200
The day Young Master was taken away,

20:47.240 --> 20:49.224
I saw how worried
Second Young Lady was...

20:54.160 --> 20:55.350
- Yuchan.
- Yuchan.

20:56.070 --> 20:57.430
How's your injury?

20:58.590 --> 20:59.639
It looked serious,

20:59.640 --> 21:01.560
but it was only a flesh wound.

21:01.680 --> 21:02.879
It's already scabbed over

21:02.880 --> 21:04.280
and doesn't hurt at all.

21:04.880 --> 21:06.040
That's good.

21:06.960 --> 21:08.560
Come with me to the study.

21:08.640 --> 21:10.280
I need to speak with you alone.

21:17.030 --> 21:18.320
Close the door.

21:33.550 --> 21:34.670
This is

21:34.830 --> 21:36.110
Osmanthus cake?

21:36.750 --> 21:38.789
Before Young Master
was taken away, he told me

21:38.790 --> 21:41.280
that he'd sent Jiugao
and Nanke on an errand.

21:41.310 --> 21:42.959
If Jiugao found anything,

21:42.960 --> 21:45.320
he'd have someone
send back osmanthus cake.

21:46.310 --> 21:48.430
The cake is a signal.

21:56.680 --> 21:58.480
Young Master left a letter.

21:58.720 --> 22:00.320
If the osmanthus cake arrived,

22:00.400 --> 22:03.512
I was to deliver the letter to
Marquis Yongchang as soon as possible.

22:05.480 --> 22:07.350
Young Master asked me...

22:08.550 --> 22:09.639
Young Master said

22:09.640 --> 22:11.430
this letter would
be difficult to deliver.

22:11.440 --> 22:13.000
I'm loyal,

22:14.350 --> 22:16.040
but I'm not as brave as you.

22:16.070 --> 22:17.719
I'm not as quick-witted as you,

22:17.720 --> 22:19.430
or as decisive.

22:19.496 --> 22:21.690
He wanted you to come
with me to deliver the letter.

22:21.700 --> 22:22.999
(Letter from Lin Jinqi)
Make sure

22:23.000 --> 22:25.040
the letter reaches
Marquis Yongchang personally.

22:27.160 --> 22:28.480
Young Master said

22:28.750 --> 22:32.280
there'll be a generous reward
if we succeed.

22:33.240 --> 22:35.110
What if we fail?

22:39.960 --> 22:42.670
When the nest falls,
no egg remains unbroken.

22:43.590 --> 22:45.480
We're servants of the Lin family.

22:45.960 --> 22:47.480
If something happens to Young Master,

22:47.920 --> 22:49.520
neither of us will fare well.

22:56.616 --> 22:58.670
They say a marquis's
gates are as deep as the sea.

22:58.680 --> 22:59.959
How can two young maids like us

22:59.960 --> 23:01.910
ever get to see Marquis Yongchang?

23:13.550 --> 23:15.800
Young Master wrote this before he left.

23:15.880 --> 23:17.208
He said that many years ago,

23:17.240 --> 23:19.020
when he happened
to meet Marquis Yongchang,

23:19.030 --> 23:21.150
the Marquis casually said these words.

23:22.200 --> 23:24.808
How could Dingyuan remain
[*Dingyuan refers to Ban Chao, who left]

23:24.810 --> 23:27.150
a scholar all his life?
[*the scholar's life for a military career.]

23:27.160 --> 23:29.256
Who under heaven
[*Bohai refers to the poet Gao Shi,]

23:29.288 --> 23:31.800
would not know Bohai?
[*who was known as the Marquis of Bohai.]

23:32.104 --> 23:35.350
I've thought it over again and again,
but I still can't think of a good way.

23:35.624 --> 23:38.350
Now that Young Master has been
dismissed and is under investigation,

23:38.440 --> 23:41.390
the Lin family has no ties
with Marquis Yongchang's household,

23:41.510 --> 23:44.070
and Young Master has never
had dealings with him either.

23:44.152 --> 23:45.768
Even if Master took Young Master's note

23:45.800 --> 23:48.040
to Marquis Yongchang's residence
and asked to see him,

23:48.110 --> 23:50.870
Marquis Yongchang probably
wouldn't receive him.

23:52.480 --> 23:54.509
Much less two young maids like us.

23:54.510 --> 23:56.590
Not only do we have
to see Marquis Yongchang,

23:56.700 --> 23:58.380
but we must do it
without alerting anyone.

23:58.920 --> 24:00.150
I have an idea.

24:00.380 --> 24:03.679
(Jiangdong Gate)

24:03.680 --> 24:06.040
Why did we come outside the city?

24:06.830 --> 24:09.069
When Marquis Yongchang leaves
the Xinjiangkou Naval Camp

24:09.070 --> 24:10.509
and returns to his residence,

24:10.510 --> 24:12.749
he'll most likely enter
through Jiangdong Gate,

24:12.750 --> 24:15.110
then pass through Sanshan Gate
into the inner city.

24:16.070 --> 24:16.749
This road

24:16.750 --> 24:19.430
is the only route
from Jiangdong Gate to Sanshan Gate.

24:19.750 --> 24:20.870
But

24:20.960 --> 24:23.000
what if His Lordship
doesn't take this route?

24:25.440 --> 24:26.800
We'll have to take that chance.

24:28.000 --> 24:31.070
We can only do our best
and leave the rest to fate.

24:48.460 --> 24:54.020
(Jiangdong Gate)

24:58.100 --> 25:04.020
(Yuan Shaohui, Marquis Yongchang,
Commander of the Xinjiangkou Naval Camp)

25:12.440 --> 25:19.309
♪How could Dingyuan
remain a scholar all his life?♪

25:19.310 --> 25:26.910
♪Who under heaven
would not know Bohai?♪

25:26.960 --> 25:33.829
♪How could Dingyuan
remain a scholar all his life?♪

25:33.830 --> 25:41.280
♪Who under heaven
would not know Bohai?♪

25:51.750 --> 25:55.159
We're maids from
the Lin Residence on Yanling Lane.

25:55.160 --> 25:55.749
We were...

25:55.750 --> 25:57.560
sent by our master

25:57.640 --> 25:59.630
to deliver a letter to Your Lordship.

26:04.070 --> 26:05.910
Lin Fengtai is imprisoned.

26:06.310 --> 26:08.200
If he has evidence
that can prove his innocence,

26:08.264 --> 26:10.430
he should submit it
to the Central Military Command.

26:12.550 --> 26:14.040
Your Lordship!

26:14.552 --> 26:17.320
If Young Master refuses to submit it
to the Central Military Command,

26:17.336 --> 26:18.800
he must have his reasons.

26:20.350 --> 26:21.430
Your Lordship.

26:21.880 --> 26:23.200
Commander Yuan!

26:27.384 --> 26:29.230
In the sixth year
of the late Emperor's reign,

26:29.240 --> 26:30.910
the Xinjiangkou
Naval Camp was established

26:30.920 --> 26:33.480
with eight thousand naval troops
to oversee the river defenses.

26:34.160 --> 26:36.670
All bandits and illegal salt traders

26:36.760 --> 26:37.896
were to be apprehended,

26:37.912 --> 26:40.152
while the camp also guarded
against Wo pirates.

26:48.350 --> 26:49.670
Commander Yuan,

26:49.750 --> 26:51.928
you are the Commander
of the Xinjiangkou Naval Camp,

26:51.930 --> 26:54.720
not one of the Three Judicial Offices
that investigate wrongful cases.

26:54.750 --> 26:56.879
If Young Master
sent a letter to Commander Yuan,

26:56.880 --> 26:59.390
it naturally wasn't to ask you
to investigate his case.

26:59.480 --> 27:00.520
Then what is it about?

27:06.310 --> 27:07.830
The river defenses.

27:18.110 --> 27:18.910
The letter.

27:44.750 --> 27:45.590
Return to camp.

27:45.960 --> 27:47.520
Take these two maids back with us.

27:47.750 --> 27:49.870
Do not release them without my orders.

27:50.030 --> 27:50.830
- Yes.
- Yes.

27:57.540 --> 27:59.860
(Jiangdong Gate)

28:01.830 --> 28:02.720
- Move.
- Move.

28:09.030 --> 28:10.150
Lanxiang,

28:10.680 --> 28:12.720
did we just make things
worse for Young Master?

28:13.310 --> 28:15.070
We did what Young Master

28:15.110 --> 28:16.670
asked us to do.

28:17.720 --> 28:18.760
Really?

28:24.270 --> 28:25.639
You haven't read the letter.

28:25.640 --> 28:27.349
How did you know it was

28:27.350 --> 28:28.870
about the river defenses?

28:29.440 --> 28:30.670
I was bluffing.

28:33.550 --> 28:36.350
But now it seems I was right.

28:38.510 --> 28:40.350
What if you'd guessed wrong

28:40.510 --> 28:43.200
and the letter wasn't
about the river defenses?

28:44.110 --> 28:45.879
Then we'd still end up

28:45.880 --> 28:47.320
being arrested, just like now.

28:52.260 --> 28:53.239
(Longjiang Pass Wharf)

28:53.240 --> 28:54.399
Be careful.

28:54.400 --> 28:55.589
None of this cargo is heavy,

28:55.590 --> 28:56.830
but you still can't be careless.

29:00.380 --> 29:01.639
(Longjiang Pass Wharf)

29:01.640 --> 29:02.870
Set sail.

29:03.030 --> 29:04.589
I'll take you to Taicang,

29:04.590 --> 29:06.264
and then I have
to hurry back to Jinling.

29:06.920 --> 29:08.789
Lin Jinqi forced Lord Fujiwara

29:08.790 --> 29:10.320
to take his own life.

29:10.480 --> 29:12.240
We must avenge him.

29:13.310 --> 29:15.919
I doubt he'll
live long enough to see you.

29:15.920 --> 29:16.959
Once he's convicted,

29:16.960 --> 29:18.159
we'll find a way

29:18.160 --> 29:21.240
to make Lin Jinqi appear to take
his own life in prison out of guilt.

29:47.590 --> 29:49.549
(Ding Peng, Yuan Shaohui's Aide, Assistant Commander)
The Naval Camp is here

29:49.550 --> 29:52.000
to apprehend the Wo pirates!
Kill anyone who resists!

30:04.110 --> 30:05.240
Board the ship!

30:52.240 --> 30:53.309
Count everyone!

30:53.310 --> 30:54.670
Take them all away!

31:28.410 --> 31:29.850
My Lord.

31:32.830 --> 31:35.670
- Thank you, My Lord.
- Thank you, My Lord.

31:35.830 --> 31:38.070
Thank you, My Lord.

31:38.110 --> 31:39.959
Thank you
for delivering justice, My Lord.

31:39.960 --> 31:41.349
Thank you, My Lord.

31:41.350 --> 31:42.390
Please, rise.

31:42.650 --> 31:44.100
Thank you, My Lord.

31:54.296 --> 31:56.470
These women are skilled
at spinning and weaving.

31:56.480 --> 31:58.232
The Wo took advantage of their poverty

31:58.280 --> 32:00.560
and their eagerness to earn money
to lure them aboard,

32:00.570 --> 32:02.090
intending to abduct them to Wo country.

32:05.000 --> 32:06.280
As for this matter,

32:06.350 --> 32:08.320
I will report the facts to my superiors

32:08.360 --> 32:10.150
and commend Fengtai for his service.

32:13.800 --> 32:16.072
- Thank you, Your Lordship.
- Thank you, Your Lordship.

32:22.310 --> 32:23.200
Young Master.

32:39.640 --> 32:41.280
They know they wronged you.

32:41.350 --> 32:43.464
When they heard you were
being released this morning,

32:43.480 --> 32:45.479
they specially took leave
to come and welcome you

32:45.480 --> 32:46.800
and apologize.

32:53.070 --> 32:55.000
Please punish us,
Assistant Commander Lin.

32:55.064 --> 32:58.568
- Please punish us, Assistant Commander Lin.
- Please punish us, Assistant Commander Lin.

32:58.960 --> 33:00.399
Assistant Commander Lin meant well

33:00.400 --> 33:02.280
and tried to secure
better treatment for us,

33:02.350 --> 33:04.479
but we were blinded
by our own foolishness

33:04.480 --> 33:06.430
and mistook a good man for a bad one,

33:06.480 --> 33:09.670
causing Assistant Commander Lin
to suffer such humiliation.

33:09.720 --> 33:12.040
Yet Assistant Commander Lin
bore us no grudge

33:12.070 --> 33:14.549
and went to great lengths
to uncover the true culprit,

33:14.550 --> 33:16.830
so our fallen brothers
can finally rest in peace.

33:16.920 --> 33:19.656
We offer our deepest thanks
to Assistant Commander Lin.

33:19.688 --> 33:22.020
- Our deepest thanks, Assistant Commander Lin.
- Our deepest thanks, Assistant Commander Lin.

33:22.030 --> 33:22.679
Get up.

33:22.680 --> 33:23.960
Everyone, get up and speak.

33:24.070 --> 33:25.280
Get up and speak!

33:25.440 --> 33:26.200
Get up.

33:29.550 --> 33:30.870
As your commanding officer,

33:31.070 --> 33:32.829
seeking justice for my men

33:32.830 --> 33:34.320
was always my duty.

33:34.590 --> 33:37.240
I merely did what I should.

33:37.480 --> 33:38.670
As for all of you,

33:39.030 --> 33:41.670
you had the courage to speak up
for your wrongfully killed brothers

33:41.790 --> 33:44.200
and refused to let
the true culprit escape justice.

33:44.270 --> 33:45.760
That is what deserves respect.

33:46.240 --> 33:47.590
We're simple men.

33:47.750 --> 33:49.480
We don't know how to say anything fancy.

33:49.720 --> 33:51.280
But from this day on,

33:51.350 --> 33:54.480
you have our complete respect.

33:54.552 --> 33:57.349
Whatever Assistant Commander Lin
tells us to do, we'll do it.

33:57.350 --> 33:58.269
No questions asked.

33:58.270 --> 33:59.719
We'll follow Assistant Commander Lin.

33:59.720 --> 34:03.160
- We'll follow Assistant Commander Lin.
- We'll follow Assistant Commander Lin.

34:03.208 --> 34:12.870
- We'll follow Assistant Commander Lin.
- We'll follow Assistant Commander Lin.

34:21.190 --> 34:21.919
Young Master.

34:21.920 --> 34:29.180
(Uphold the Family's Honor)

34:41.710 --> 34:43.200
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

34:55.710 --> 34:57.390
Let's wash away Young Master's bad luck,

34:57.400 --> 34:58.990
so everything goes smoothly from now on.

35:02.744 --> 35:04.270
May fortune and prosperity follow.

35:04.280 --> 35:05.589
May everything go smoothly.

35:05.590 --> 35:06.744
Wash away the bad luck.

35:06.776 --> 35:08.700
May fortune
and prosperity follow from now on.

35:08.710 --> 35:10.149
May everything go smoothly.

35:10.150 --> 35:12.709
Nanny Wu, help Jiugao and Nanke
wash away their bad luck, too.

35:12.710 --> 35:13.430
All right.

35:15.280 --> 35:16.320
All right.

35:19.704 --> 35:22.020
May fortune and prosperity follow.
Wash away the bad luck.

35:22.030 --> 35:24.470
Mother, are you washing away
my bad luck or beating your son?

35:24.488 --> 35:26.020
Am I really your own son?

35:26.030 --> 35:28.959
Spare the rod and spoil the child.
Of course I'd beat my own son.

35:28.960 --> 35:30.200
Wash away the bad luck.

35:34.150 --> 35:35.680
I made you worry, Mother.

35:42.840 --> 35:44.320
I'm just glad you're back.

35:46.480 --> 35:48.320
Go change your clothes,

35:48.440 --> 35:51.030
and then pay your respects
to Old Master and Old Madam

35:51.190 --> 35:53.229
so they won't keep worrying about you.

35:53.230 --> 35:54.030
All right.

35:58.190 --> 35:59.149
Your father...

35:59.150 --> 36:01.669
Father and Second Uncle
got into another fight

36:01.670 --> 36:03.799
after arguing over Jinqi's situation.

36:03.800 --> 36:06.800
Old Master ordered them to stay in
the rooms and reflect on their actions.

36:07.230 --> 36:10.240
Later, let Aunt Lingxiao
know you're safe, too.

36:10.360 --> 36:13.640
Thankfully, she's been
keeping me company every day.

36:14.550 --> 36:15.669
What about me?

36:15.670 --> 36:17.350
I've been keeping you company, too.

36:17.880 --> 36:19.390
You've done your part, too.

36:20.070 --> 36:21.640
Tell me what you want later,

36:21.670 --> 36:22.709
and I'll buy it for you.

36:22.710 --> 36:24.879
As long as you're safe

36:24.880 --> 36:26.390
and Mother is happy,

36:26.480 --> 36:28.240
I have everything I need.

36:37.360 --> 36:38.470
Mother.

36:39.510 --> 36:41.120
These are tears of joy.

36:43.960 --> 36:45.800
Go change and freshen up.

36:49.280 --> 36:50.390
I'll take my leave.

36:57.110 --> 36:58.030
Mother.

37:10.840 --> 37:12.030
Where are Yuchan and Lanxiang?

37:12.872 --> 37:14.024
Yesterday afternoon,

37:14.056 --> 37:16.072
Yuchan said she was acting
on Young Master's orders

37:16.104 --> 37:17.950
and took Lanxiang out on an errand.

37:17.960 --> 37:19.350
They still haven't returned.

37:20.360 --> 37:21.600
Go get Jiugao.

37:38.360 --> 37:39.280
Young Master.

37:42.400 --> 37:43.950
Where did Yuchan and Lanxiang go?

37:44.190 --> 37:44.840
They...

37:45.360 --> 37:46.800
They're still not back?

37:46.856 --> 37:48.870
Marquis Yongchang
was afraid word might get out,

37:48.960 --> 37:50.149
so he had Yuchan and Lanxiang

37:50.150 --> 37:51.600
taken to the Naval Camp.

37:51.960 --> 37:54.280
I thought after we caught
the Wo pirates last night,

37:54.344 --> 37:56.640
Marquis Yongchang would send
someone to bring them back.

37:57.550 --> 37:59.600
Could Marquis Yongchang
have simply forgotten

37:59.710 --> 38:01.830
about Yuchan and Lanxiang?

38:02.000 --> 38:03.800
Yuchan has never
been inside a military camp.

38:03.840 --> 38:04.919
Being kept there all night

38:04.920 --> 38:06.390
must have frightened her badly.

38:06.670 --> 38:07.669
No.

38:07.670 --> 38:09.800
I have to go to the Naval Camp
and bring her back.

38:10.550 --> 38:11.430
Stop.

38:13.000 --> 38:14.320
I'll go with you.

38:14.710 --> 38:15.709
Young Master.

38:15.710 --> 38:17.669
What about Old Master and Old Madam?

38:17.670 --> 38:20.229
Tell Old Master I have
something urgent to take care of.

38:20.230 --> 38:22.430
I'll pay my respects
and apologize when I return.

38:25.992 --> 38:28.350
So Young Master has business
with Marquis Yongchang.

38:28.800 --> 38:29.910
You gave me quite a fright.

38:31.710 --> 38:33.069
Official business comes first.

38:33.070 --> 38:34.640
Go take care of it, Young Master.

38:37.110 --> 38:41.029
One, two! One, two!

38:41.030 --> 38:43.870
(Naval Camp)
One, two! One!

38:49.220 --> 38:55.300
(Xinjiangkou Naval Camp)

39:04.030 --> 39:05.280
Commander Yuan.

39:06.120 --> 39:07.544
Forgive me for coming unannounced.

39:07.590 --> 39:10.240
First, I came especially
to thank Commander Yuan.

39:10.480 --> 39:11.999
Second, I was hoping to

39:12.000 --> 39:14.390
take our two maids home on my way back.

39:16.344 --> 39:17.752
As for what happened this time,

39:17.800 --> 39:19.870
I should be the one
thanking you, Fengtai.

39:20.320 --> 39:21.189
The river defenses

39:21.190 --> 39:23.280
are my responsibility
in the first place.

39:24.000 --> 39:25.709
If the Wo pirates' smuggling ship

39:25.710 --> 39:27.439
had sailed out
of the Sancha River Estuary,

39:27.440 --> 39:29.589
it would have been
much harder to stop them

39:29.590 --> 39:31.176
from sailing downriver and out to sea.

39:31.710 --> 39:33.550
Fortunately, you warned me.

39:35.110 --> 39:36.509
Everything I did

39:36.510 --> 39:38.430
was following Commander Yuan's example.

39:38.670 --> 39:40.839
If Commander Yuan hadn't

39:40.840 --> 39:42.830
said those words
that opened my eyes back then,

39:42.904 --> 39:44.730
there wouldn't be
an Assistant Commander Lin

39:44.740 --> 39:46.984
who gave up the scholar's
path and took up arms today.

39:49.480 --> 39:50.488
I had planned to send

39:50.520 --> 39:52.830
the two young ladies back
first thing this morning.

39:52.920 --> 39:54.709
But too many people objected,

39:54.710 --> 39:56.584
and I couldn't
go against everyone's wishes.

40:10.030 --> 40:14.870
- Good!
- Good!

40:15.400 --> 40:27.680
- Good!
- Good!

40:30.840 --> 40:32.589
That yellow-dappled horse

40:32.590 --> 40:34.680
seemed to sense its master's urgency

40:35.000 --> 40:36.830
to save his benefactor,

40:36.920 --> 40:39.030
and galloped with all its might,

40:39.190 --> 40:41.109
hot breath blasting from its nostrils

40:41.110 --> 40:42.629
and foam spilling from its mouth.

40:42.630 --> 40:44.430
At last, they arrived.

40:44.920 --> 40:46.669
Qin Qiong cried out desperately,

40:46.670 --> 40:49.069
"Stay your blade!"

40:49.070 --> 40:50.509
- Good!
- Good!

40:50.510 --> 40:53.830
- Good!
- Good!

40:58.030 --> 41:01.080
But he was just a moment too late.

41:01.110 --> 41:03.029
The blade came down,

41:03.030 --> 41:04.509
blood sprayed through the air,

41:04.510 --> 41:06.830
and Shan Xiongxin's
head rolled to the ground.

41:07.230 --> 41:10.280
Overcome with grief,
Qin Qiong rushed forward,

41:10.320 --> 41:12.640
but could only gather up Shan Xiongxin's

41:13.190 --> 41:15.760
bloodied head.

41:22.510 --> 41:24.350
The still-warm blood

41:25.440 --> 41:27.600
ran over Qin Qiong's hands,

41:29.320 --> 41:33.030
and memories flooded his mind.

41:35.150 --> 41:36.280
Back then,

41:37.190 --> 41:38.950
he had fallen on hard times in Luzhou

41:39.440 --> 41:41.030
and become gravely ill.

41:41.510 --> 41:42.919
He had no choice but to sell

41:42.920 --> 41:44.830
his beloved yellow-dappled horse.

41:45.480 --> 41:47.600
Shan Xiongxin,
who came to buy the horse,

41:47.710 --> 41:49.830
took to him immediately

41:50.710 --> 41:53.350
and cared for him
devotedly for eight months.

41:54.510 --> 41:56.030
Once Qin Qiong recovered,

41:56.320 --> 41:59.919
he fitted the yellow-dappled horse with
golden stirrups and a silver saddle,

41:59.920 --> 42:03.280
and then gave Qin Qiong Lu silk
and generous funds for his journey.

42:05.880 --> 42:06.990
And now,

42:07.630 --> 42:09.919
Qin Qiong came riding back

42:09.920 --> 42:14.030
on the yellow-dappled horse with
golden stirrups and a silver saddle.

42:14.920 --> 42:16.470
But Shan Xiongxin

42:19.800 --> 42:20.999
was gone.

42:21.000 --> 42:28.479
♪I no longer blame the moon
for withholding its light♪

42:28.480 --> 42:36.020
♪I only pray that those
I've known still live and thrive♪

42:36.120 --> 42:39.799
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

42:39.800 --> 42:49.320
- Good!
- Good!

42:50.800 --> 42:52.240
I came all this way to get you

42:52.480 --> 42:54.390
and missed the best part.

43:05.020 --> 43:08.260
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:14.480 --> 43:15.229
I will never

43:15.230 --> 43:16.870
marry an old man.

43:17.110 --> 43:18.589
I'm a person,

43:18.590 --> 43:20.550
not something for my family to show off.

43:21.440 --> 43:23.470
Marquis's wife, Madam Ma, huh?

43:23.528 --> 43:25.200
Whoever wants
those titles can have them.

43:51.701 --> 43:55.821
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

43:58.661 --> 44:03.181
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:04.461 --> 44:08.381
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:09.061 --> 44:11.821
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:12.541 --> 44:14.861
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:14.861 --> 44:17.941
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:19.461 --> 44:23.701
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:26.621 --> 44:30.781
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:32.581 --> 44:36.141
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:36.141 --> 44:39.701
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:40.501 --> 44:46.181
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:46.541 --> 44:50.861
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:51.221 --> 44:54.181
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:54.181 --> 44:57.941
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:57.941 --> 45:00.821
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

